MEMFRONT2 implementation changes are confined to new orchestration/analysis files under memfront2/. Frozen THEORYCOMPLY files under SOURCES/src/scalecert/ were not modified. The orchestration adds sparse left/right spectral diagnostics, direct one-shock trajectories with explicit Gaussian tail-loss envelopes, diagnostic tail completion, and fail-closed output assembly. `spectral_reconstruct` suppresses the numerical Perron drift from float64 column-sum roundoff; this adjustment is documented in memfront2/spectral.py and its effect is included in the reported residual/closure failure. No final-state kernel, hidden-support DP, privacy-profile or Feldman–Shenfeld adapter was changed or run.
